                The Problem
            </span>
            <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-soft-white">Every Conversation Starts From Zero</h2>
            <p class="text-graphite mt-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
                Your AI assistant is brilliant&mdash;but it forgets everything the moment the session ends.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
            <div class="card border-red-900/30">
                <div class="text-red-400 text-3xl mb-4">&#x1F504;</div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-soft-white mb-2">Repetitive Explanations</h3>
                <p class="text-graphite">You explain your project structure, coding preferences, and context over and over again.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card border-red-900/30">
                <div class="text-red-400 text-3xl mb-4">&#x1F50D;</div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-soft-white mb-2">Lost Context</h3>
                <p class="text-graphite">That important decision you made yesterday? Your AI has no idea it happened.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card border-red-900/30">
                <div class="text-red-400 text-3xl mb-4">&#x23F3;</div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-soft-white mb-2">Wasted Time</h3>
                <p class="text-graphite">Hours lost re-establishing context that should just... be there.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Solution Section -->
<section id="how-it-works" class="bg-navy py-24">
