                    <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-lg font-bold flex-shrink-0" style="background: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.2); color: #22D3EE;">2</div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="text-soft-white font-semibold text-lg">AI Stores What Matters</div>
                        <div class="text-graphite">Decisions, preferences, project context&mdash;automatically captured and indexed.</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                    <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-lg font-bold flex-shrink-0" style="background: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.2); color: #22D3EE;">3</div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="text-soft-white font-semibold text-lg">Context Flows Automatically</div>
                        <div class="text-graphite">Your AI retrieves relevant memories when it needs them&mdash;no prompting required.</div>
