            <div class="card">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-soft-white mb-2">What's a "credit"?</h3>
                <p class="text-graphite">One credit = one memory operation (store, search, or update). Most users do 50-200 operations per active coding session.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-soft-white mb-2">Does it work with my AI tool?</h3>
                <p class="text-graphite">If your tool supports MCP (Model Context Protocol), yes. This includes Claude Desktop, Cursor, Windsurf, and others. Check our docs for the full list.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-soft-white mb-2">Is my data secure?</h3>
                <p class="text-graphite">Yes. All data is encrypted at rest and in transit. Each tenant is isolated with row-level security. We never share or train on your data.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-soft-white mb-2">Can I export my memories?</h3>
                <p class="text-graphite">Absolutely. Full JSON export is available anytime. Your data is yours&mdash;no lock-in.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-soft-white mb-2">What if I need more than Enterprise?</h3>
                <p class="text-graphite">We offer on-premise deployment for organizations with specific compliance or scale requirements. Let's talk.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

